      },
      "arithmetic": [
        "Salary grows at inflation + margin = 2.5% + 1% = 3.5% a year, one step per row",
        "2027 (row 1, age 35): $145,000 x 1.035 = $150,075.00",
        "2042 (row 16, age 50, the last working year): $145,000 x 1.035^16 = $251,427.98",
